bic elevators. Navigate shifting floors to scavenge food, weapons, and hope. Linger too long? The zombies get <i>very</i> friendly. Survive, escape, and maybe snag a reward\u2014or not.[/p]</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4-player <strong>co-op zombie survival</strong> to test your skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive <strong>bodycam FPS</strong> HUD.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever-changing floors for endless <strong>elevator survival</strong> chaos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time-driven zombie waves make every second a nightmare.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach the surface\u2026 if you\u2019re that lucky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step inside. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The elevator\u2019s waiting. Survive, or don\u2019t. Who cares?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3789160?t=1768947835","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3789160?t=1768947835","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789160/f0645547a6aa61587f56667aa8ec5fb61074b43c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768947835","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789160/f0645547a6aa61587f56667aa8ec5fb61074b43c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768947835","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3813450,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Twitch Integration in DEMO!\u00a0 Fight your chat!</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragrap